    IF `the document is a claim referral certificate within the meaning given by section 2(1) of the Employment Claims Act 2016`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "have the meanings given by section 2(1) of the Employment Claims Act 2016"
        JUST FALSE

